     1,
     "\n  \n    \n  \n  <div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" text=\"#333333\">\n    <font face=\"Calibri\">Uau, to je pa super novica! In moďż˝an magnet -\n      septembra se zagotovo vidimo!<br>\n      <br>\n      Prijeten dan vsem Rkoholikom!<br>\n      Urďż˝a<br>\n      <br>\n    </font><br>\n    On 24.1.2012 12:38, Andrej Blejec wrote:\n    <blockquote type=\"cite\">\n      \n      \n      \n      <div>\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Z veseljem vas obveďż˝ďż˝am, da bo Hadley\n          Wickham eden od plenarnih predavateljev na septembrski\n          konferenci Applied Statistics 2012 v Ribnem (<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><a href=\"http://conferences.nib.si/AS2011\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://conferences.nib.si/AS2011&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237657233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1yT1NxEY9zVEyLL3Wp5ztZ\"><span style=\"color:blue\">http://conferences.nib.si/AS2012</span></a></span>ďż˝).<u></u><u></u></p>\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Razen vabljenega predavanja bo vodil tudi\n          workshop po zakljuďż˝ku konference. Dogovarjam se, da bo ostal\n          ďż˝e kak dan v Ljubljani in kaj povedal ďż˝e na sestanku\n          Rkoholikov.<u></u><u></u></p>\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u>ďż˝<u></u></p>\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Lep pozdrav<u></u><u></u></p>\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Andrej<u></u><u></u></p>\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u>ďż˝<u></u></p></div></blockquote></div>"
