     1,
     "\n\n\n\n\n\n<div lang=\"SL\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Z veseljem vas obveščam, da bo Hadley Wickham eden od plenarnih predavateljev na septembrski konferenci Applied Statistics 2012 v Ribnem (<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><a href=\"http://conferences.nib.si/AS2011\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://conferences.nib.si/AS2011&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237657232000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0J8MAWplmfXm3ZUY3a6qYq\"><span style=\"color:blue\">http://conferences.nib.si/AS2012</span></a></span> ).<u></u><u></u></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Razen vabljenega predavanja bo vodil tudi workshop po zaključku konference. Dogovarjam se, da bo ostal še kak dan v Ljubljani in kaj povedal še na sestanku Rkoholikov.<u></u><u></u></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Lep pozdrav<u></u><u></u></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Andrej<u></u><u></u></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">--<br>\nAndrej Blejec<br>\nNational Institute of Biology<br>\nVecna pot 111 POB 141, SI-1000 Ljubljana, SLOVENIA<u></u><u></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">e-mail:\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:blue\">andrej...@nib.si</span></a><br>\nURL: <a href=\"http://ablejec.nib.si/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ablejec.nib.si/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237657232000&amp;usg=AOvVaw160B4WhlU5n7quSEA-82Xe\"><span style=\"color:blue\">http://ablejec.nib.si</span></a>\n<br>\ntel: + 386 (0)59 232 789<br>\nfax: <a href=\"tel:+386%201%20241%2029%2080\" value=\"+38612412980\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+ 386 1 241 29 80</a><br>\n--------------------------<br>\nOrganizer of<br>\nApplied Statistics 2012 conference<br>\n<a href=\"http://conferences.nib.si/AS2011\" t